      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We performed long-term maintenance LDL apheresis therapy on patients with hypercholesterolemia after undergoing PTCA, and investigated the therapeutic effects of reducing serum cholesterol, LDL-cholesterol and Lp(a). LDL apheresis significantly reduced serum lipids and was an efficacious therapy in the prevention of recurrent stenosis after PTCA."},
